    "overview": "The Ant Esports MK1300 V2 is a 60% compact mechanical keyboard with 61 keys, built for gamers and typists who want a clutter-free desk without giving up performance. Its hot-swappable Outemu Brown switches deliver tactile feedback with reduced noise, and can be swapped out without soldering for full customization down the line. Per-key RGB backlighting lights up every keycap individually, giving complete control over lighting effects and colours, while full anti-ghosting and N-key rollover ensure every keystroke registers cleanly during fast-paced play. A detachable 1.5m braided USB-C cable adds durability and portability, and the keyboard is rated for 50 million keystrokes for years of reliable use in black with dual-tone keycaps.",
